message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."
title: "CAGE: Composition-Aware Guard Evaluation for Agentic AI"
abstract: >-
  CAGE is a runtime reference monitor and evaluation harness for tool-calling
  LLM agents. CAGE-Guard intercepts every proposed tool call and returns
  allow, block or ask, enforcing a source-to-sink rule, an argument
  consistency rule that routes delegated sensitive parameters to user
  confirmation, and a message-body content heuristic. CAGE-Eval runs identical
  attack and benign cases under four conditions and exports the raw decision
  logs and metrics; the CAGE Console displays them.
type: software
